WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.416 --> 00:00:30.000
In the previous verses,

2
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.750
Lord Krishna described

3
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:34.166
His supreme abode and explained that

4
00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:38.333
those who take His shelter reach there.

5
00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:41.791
Now He reveals the identity of the soul –

6
00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:45.375
the very soul that struggles, wanders,

7
00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:48.541
and ultimately seeks liberation.

8
00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:49.166
This verse

9
00:00:49.166 --> 00:00:52.625
also explains who the jivatma is

10
00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:54.000
that is caught in this world.

11
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.958
Lord Krishna makes clear – every soul

12
00:00:56.958 --> 00:00:59.541
is His own eternal fragment.

13
00:01:04.208 --> 00:01:07.500
Here Lord Krishna says in this verse–

14
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:12.166
‘Mamaivamsho jivaloke jivabhutah sanatanah.’

15
00:01:12.166 --> 00:01:15.416
The soul is eternally

16
00:01:15.416 --> 00:01:18.291
a fragment of Lord Krishna.

17
00:01:18.291 --> 00:01:21.250
This is a profoundly deep statement.

18
00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:24.500
Even though the soul is presently
in the material world

19
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.708
and struggling due to forgetting

20
00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:29.416
its true nature,

21
00:01:29.416 --> 00:01:32.875
its original identity – being the beloved

22
00:01:32.875 --> 00:01:36.625
servant of Lord Krishna – is never destroyed.

23
00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:39.708
The word sanatana carries special significance.

24
00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:40.500
Lord Krishna

25
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.833
is rejecting the belief

26
00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:44.000
that says

27
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.458
that a person only temporarily
comes into existence.

28
00:01:48.458 --> 00:01:50.041
He clearly says –

29
00:01:50.041 --> 00:01:52.958
you have always existed,

30
00:01:52.958 --> 00:01:54.416
you are Mine, and you were

31
00:01:54.416 --> 00:01:57.416
always meant to be with Me.

32
00:01:57.416 --> 00:01:58.500
But

33
00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:02.208
what is happening right now?

34
00:02:02.208 --> 00:02:05.166
‘Manah-shashthani indriyani

35
00:02:05.166 --> 00:02:07.125
prakriti-sthani karshati.’

36
00:02:07.125 --> 00:02:10.041
Being situated in material prakriti,

37
00:02:10.041 --> 00:02:11.833
the soul is being pulled

38
00:02:11.833 --> 00:02:16.000
and struggled with by the six senses
including the mind.

39
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:20.333
Karshati means – to drag or pull.

40
00:02:20.333 --> 00:02:21.666
Like a person

41
00:02:21.666 --> 00:02:25.000
bound in chains dragging a heavy weight –

42
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:28.125
this is the experience of the soul

43
00:02:28.125 --> 00:02:29.041
when the senses

44
00:02:29.041 --> 00:02:32.458
pull it in different directions.

45
00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:36.541
The mind is the sixth and most
powerful sense here.

46
00:02:36.541 --> 00:02:38.583
It creates endless desires,

47
00:02:38.583 --> 00:02:42.416
fears, attachments, and plans.

48
00:02:42.416 --> 00:02:43.708
In sattva, this same mind

49
00:02:43.708 --> 00:02:45.708
makes us virtuous.

50
00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:46.416
In rajas,

51
00:02:46.416 --> 00:02:49.500
it arouses ambition and restlessness.

52
00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:52.791
And in tamas, it pushes us deeper

53
00:02:52.791 --> 00:02:55.875
into sorrow.

54
00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:59.125
The inner world binds us more

55
00:02:59.125 --> 00:03:00.833
than the outer world.

56
00:03:00.833 --> 00:03:03.958
This is the root cause of our suffering –

57
00:03:03.958 --> 00:03:05.375
not fate

58
00:03:05.375 --> 00:03:07.250
or external circumstances,

59
00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:10.916
but the uncontrolled mind and senses

60
00:03:10.916 --> 00:03:13.833
that keep us under their control.

61
00:03:13.833 --> 00:03:15.458
Yet Lord Krishna

62
00:03:15.458 --> 00:03:18.708
does not end the verse in despair.

63
00:03:18.708 --> 00:03:20.750
He reminds us –

64
00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:24.208
even while we struggle,

65
00:03:24.208 --> 00:03:26.166
we are still His fragments.

66
00:03:26.166 --> 00:03:29.166
And this identity never changes.

67
00:03:29.166 --> 00:03:31.958
However far we wander,

68
00:03:31.958 --> 00:03:34.916
we are always part of Him.

69
00:03:34.916 --> 00:03:38.625
So what is the solution?

70
00:03:38.625 --> 00:03:43.166
To reawaken that eternal relationship.

71
00:03:43.166 --> 00:03:46.583
When we want to enjoy freely,

72
00:03:46.583 --> 00:03:49.000
the senses still pull us

73
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.000
and we suffer.

74
00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:51.958
But when

75
00:03:51.958 --> 00:03:53.375
we engage the mind and senses

76
00:03:53.375 --> 00:03:55.541
in Lord Krishna’s service,

77
00:03:55.541 --> 00:03:59.500
this very struggle becomes the
path to liberation.

78
00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.708
And the most beautiful thing is –

79
00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:04.958
even in liberation we do not disappear,

80
00:04:04.958 --> 00:04:08.083
but retain our own identity.

81
00:04:08.083 --> 00:04:09.083
This verse

82
00:04:09.083 --> 00:04:13.000
returns us to our original identity –

83
00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.375
we are not helpless toys

84
00:04:16.375 --> 00:04:18.125
in the hands of fate.

85
00:04:18.125 --> 00:04:22.041
We are fragments of Lord Krishna’s
eternal light –

86
00:04:22.041 --> 00:04:26.291
temporarily bound in maya, but

87
00:04:26.291 --> 00:04:30.541
fully capable of awakening and returning.

88
00:04:35.333 --> 00:04:38.000
You must have experienced this –

89
00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:42.166
sometimes life feels heavy.

90
00:04:42.166 --> 00:04:46.833
Thoughts pull in different directions

91
00:04:46.833 --> 00:04:49.083
and you think –

92
00:04:49.083 --> 00:04:52.791
‘perhaps I am weak,

93
00:04:52.791 --> 00:04:55.708
perhaps I lack

94
00:04:55.708 --> 00:04:59.458
willpower.’

95
00:04:59.458 --> 00:05:01.666
But I want you

96
00:05:01.666 --> 00:05:04.125
to know –

97
00:05:04.125 --> 00:05:06.375
you are not broken.

98
00:05:06.375 --> 00:05:10.125
You are only disconnected.

99
00:05:10.125 --> 00:05:15.041
Understand this – you are always Mine.

100
00:05:15.041 --> 00:05:19.000
You are My eternal fragment.

101
00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:22.750
This truth never changes.

102
00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:26.041
When you forget this truth, the mind

103
00:05:26.041 --> 00:05:28.291
becomes heavy.

104
00:05:28.291 --> 00:05:30.500
It drags you through desires, fears,

105
00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:34.583
and doubts here and there.

106
00:05:34.583 --> 00:05:38.375
You think – I am alone.

107
00:05:38.375 --> 00:05:44.375
And from there, you begin to
be pulled downward.

108
00:05:44.375 --> 00:05:46.166
But the moment

109
00:05:46.166 --> 00:05:48.666
you remember

110
00:05:48.666 --> 00:05:53.541
that you are My eternal fragment –

111
00:05:53.541 --> 00:05:57.625
transformation begins right there.

112
00:05:57.625 --> 00:06:01.333
Often this happens – friends absorbed

113
00:06:01.333 --> 00:06:05.083
in materialism invite you, in
the name of enjoyment,

114
00:06:05.083 --> 00:06:08.666
to late-night parties

115
00:06:08.666 --> 00:06:12.125
and drinking.

116
00:06:12.125 --> 00:06:16.250
They pressure you to appear modern

117
00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:21.791
and present these gatherings as a
way to build connections.

118
00:06:21.791 --> 00:06:24.666
At that moment, remember –

119
00:06:24.666 --> 00:06:28.916
recognition and success gained through
the wrong path

120
00:06:28.916 --> 00:06:32.041
is only illusion, and temporary.

121
00:06:32.041 --> 00:06:35.791
The path of devotion that leads toward Me

122
00:06:35.791 --> 00:06:39.708
is the only true path.

123
00:06:39.708 --> 00:06:41.875
True confidence

124
00:06:41.875 --> 00:06:45.916
does not come from talent or control –

125
00:06:45.916 --> 00:06:49.000
it comes from knowing

126
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:53.583
where you are truly from

127
00:06:53.583 --> 00:06:58.125
and what power lies within you.

128
00:06:58.125 --> 00:07:00.708
You are struggling?

129
00:07:00.708 --> 00:07:04.458
Yes. But you are

130
00:07:04.458 --> 00:07:07.041
also sacred and powerful.

131
00:07:07.041 --> 00:07:10.708
And when you reconnect with Me,

132
00:07:10.708 --> 00:07:13.208
the mind no longer drags you –

133
00:07:13.208 --> 00:07:16.541
you give it direction.

134
00:07:16.541 --> 00:07:19.041
Seeking eternal joy

135
00:07:19.041 --> 00:07:21.750
without falling under the pressure of the senses,

136
00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:25.000
and walking that very path,

137
00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:28.708
is what brings you to My shelter.

138
00:07:28.708 --> 00:07:29.833
Reflect on this.

139
00:07:34.541 --> 00:07:36.583
It is often seen –

140
00:07:36.583 --> 00:07:39.000
in families, people

141
00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:42.750
notice only each other’s faults –

142
00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:45.916
someone’s anger, someone’s irritability,

143
00:07:45.916 --> 00:07:49.125
someone’s stubbornness. But I say –

144
00:07:49.125 --> 00:07:52.250
look a little more deeply.

145
00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:58.625
Behind every habit and every struggle
there is a soul.

146
00:07:58.625 --> 00:08:00.291
And that soul

147
00:08:00.291 --> 00:08:04.166
is My eternal fragment.

148
00:08:04.166 --> 00:08:06.708
Every member of your home

149
00:08:06.708 --> 00:08:09.000
is not only a role –

150
00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.583
not just a mother, father, child, or partner.

151
00:08:11.583 --> 00:08:14.833
They are eternal jivatmas –

152
00:08:14.833 --> 00:08:18.708
struggling with mind and senses,

153
00:08:18.708 --> 00:08:20.708
just as you are.

154
00:08:20.708 --> 00:08:23.333
Sometimes they forget

155
00:08:23.333 --> 00:08:25.208
who they are.

156
00:08:25.208 --> 00:08:27.916
Sometimes you forget.

157
00:08:27.916 --> 00:08:30.000
But the truth remains –

158
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.083
you all belong to Me.

159
00:08:33.083 --> 00:08:35.625
When you remember this,

160
00:08:35.625 --> 00:08:39.375
your perspective changes.

161
00:08:39.375 --> 00:08:41.833
You become more patient,

162
00:08:41.833 --> 00:08:44.750
more compassionate.

163
00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:48.333
You stop giving surface reactions –

164
00:08:48.333 --> 00:08:51.083
and begin to speak to the soul.

165
00:08:51.083 --> 00:08:56.333
So whenever there is conflict or
confusion at home –

166
00:08:56.333 --> 00:08:58.000
stop.

167
00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:01.458
Recognise the divinity in the person before you

168
00:09:01.458 --> 00:09:04.916
and speak to them at that level.

169
00:09:04.916 --> 00:09:10.125
Behind every difficult moment
lies an opportunity –

170
00:09:10.125 --> 00:09:14.208
not only to give each other peace,

171
00:09:14.208 --> 00:09:18.958
but also to show each other the path toward Me.

172
00:09:23.708 --> 00:09:27.458
At the workplace your position may be senior –

173
00:09:27.458 --> 00:09:30.708
you may be leading a team,

174
00:09:30.708 --> 00:09:34.750
making important decisions. Yet

175
00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:37.750
the struggle continues within.

176
00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:41.166
The mind pulls in different directions.

177
00:09:41.166 --> 00:09:45.375
Sometimes you are focused, sometimes
you sink into doubt,

178
00:09:45.375 --> 00:09:48.666
stress, or overthinking.

179
00:09:48.666 --> 00:09:50.333
This is not weakness –

180
00:09:50.333 --> 00:09:53.333
this is a human condition.

181
00:09:53.333 --> 00:09:57.041
I have said – every soul

182
00:09:57.041 --> 00:09:59.666
is My eternal fragment,

183
00:09:59.666 --> 00:10:01.791
currently struggling with mind

184
00:10:01.791 --> 00:10:05.541
and senses.

185
00:10:05.541 --> 00:10:08.083
This applies to everyone –

186
00:10:08.083 --> 00:10:13.500
to senior leadership and to
the newest employee.

187
00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:17.375
So do not hide behind your position.

188
00:10:17.375 --> 00:10:23.000
And do not judge others only by their position.

189
00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:25.000
Every person is not only

190
00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:28.875
a resume – they are a soul.

191
00:10:28.875 --> 00:10:32.208
For example – if an employee’s

192
00:10:32.208 --> 00:10:36.916
repeated absence is affecting work,

193
00:10:36.916 --> 00:10:41.541
punishing them without knowing the real reason

194
00:10:41.541 --> 00:10:42.958
would be hasty.

195
00:10:42.958 --> 00:10:47.041
If, on deeper inquiry,

196
00:10:47.041 --> 00:10:48.833
the problem turns out to be human,

197
00:10:48.833 --> 00:10:53.875
leadership should stand by them in their crisis.

198
00:10:53.875 --> 00:10:55.083
In doing so,

199
00:10:55.083 --> 00:10:58.541
not only is a good human act done,

200
00:10:58.541 --> 00:11:01.541
but that employee’s dedication

201
00:11:01.541 --> 00:11:06.416
and respect for the leadership also deepens.

202
00:11:06.416 --> 00:11:09.625
When you adopt this perspective,

203
00:11:09.625 --> 00:11:13.041
the workplace changes.

204
00:11:13.041 --> 00:11:16.083
More patience, more empathy,

205
00:11:16.083 --> 00:11:19.458
and more genuine connection come.

206
00:11:19.458 --> 00:11:24.833
The next time you or a colleague
makes a mistake –

207
00:11:24.833 --> 00:11:29.625
stop, and decide with care and understanding.

208
00:11:29.625 --> 00:11:33.333
Behind that struggle is someone

209
00:11:33.333 --> 00:11:38.250
who is trying, who is sacred.

210
00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:42.250
You are not only a position –

211
00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:45.541
you are Mine.

212
00:11:45.541 --> 00:11:48.708
When everything else is unsettling you,

213
00:11:48.708 --> 00:11:52.500
this truth keeps you steady.

214
00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.791
Always remember this.
